# VITE_API_BASE_URL — optional, default http://localhost:3000 (server's
# own default PORT). The API's origin, exactly as FRONTEND_ORIGIN on the
# server names this app's origin (server/.env.example) — the two must be
# each other's counterpart for CORS (FR-1.12(b)) and the SameSite=Lax
# session cookie to both work. Vite only exposes env vars prefixed
# VITE_ to client code (import.meta.env); nothing else in this file is
# read by the build.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
